From: Diego Nepomuceno Marcos <me@diegonmarcos.com>
Date: Wed, 1 Jul 2026 12:39:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 07/14] Cloud-Dialer: self-contained offline spam screening
 (data-driven patterns + toggle)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds an offline spam filter grounded in the FOSS call-blocker model (SpamBlocker,
Yet Another Call Blocker): assets/spam_patterns.json (exact/prefix/regex rules) +
a pure SpamMatcher, wired into SimpleCallScreeningService behind config.blockKnownSpam
(default on — spam/robocall defence per build.json call_screening.rationale). Adds a
Settings 'Block known spam calls' toggle. Additive to Fossify's native
blockUnknownNumbers (non-contacts) + blockHiddenNumbers. JVM unit test included.
